    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169660/extras/704d45398c94bd05c43819270891eb36.avif?t=1747043088\" data-has-big width=800 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looney Landers</strong> is the third title in the retro-inspired <i>Class of 1983</i> arcade trilogy, following the critically acclaimed <i>Donut Dodo</i> and <i>Cash Cow DX</i>.<br><br><strong>Your mission:</strong> skydive into Chucky Charly\u2019s chaotic castle and land safely to win! But watch out - Charly has packed his home with zany contraptions designed to throw you off course. Outscoring your opponents will take speed, skill, and a dash of luck.<br><br>Perfect for players of all ages, <strong>Looney Landers</strong> offers fast, family-friendly arcade action with just the right amount of challenge. With quick sessions lasting only a few minutes, it\u2019s the ideal pick-up-and-play game for fans of classic 80s vibes.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> P1 vs P2 or P1 vs CPU</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong> CLASSIC, RANDOM &amp; 5-LIVES</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Options:</strong> Easy &amp; Hard </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Graphics:</strong> Vibrant 4-bit pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catchy Chiptunes:</strong> Original OPL FM music by naruto2413</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Bezel:</strong> Illustration by Pete Ellison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Competition:</strong> Worldwide leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRT TV Compatible:</strong> Native 240p output with 4:3 aspect ratio</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169660/extras/704d45398c94bd05c43819270891eb36.avif?t=1747043088\" data-has-big width=800 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looney Landers</strong> is the third title in the retro-inspired <i>Class of 1983</i> arcade trilogy, following the critically acclaimed <i>Donut Dodo</i> and <i>Cash Cow DX</i>.<br><br><strong>Your mission:</strong> skydive into Chucky Charly\u2019s chaotic castle and land safely to win! But watch out - Charly has packed his home with zany contraptions designed to throw you off course. Outscoring your opponents will take speed, skill, and a dash of luck.<br><br>Perfect for players of all ages, <strong>Looney Landers</strong> offers fast, family-friendly arcade action with just the right amount of challenge. With quick sessions lasting only a few minutes, it\u2019s the ideal pick-up-and-play game for fans of classic 80s vibes.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> P1 vs P2 or P1 vs CPU</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong> CLASSIC, RANDOM &amp; 5-LIVES</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Options:</strong> Easy &amp; Hard </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Graphics:</strong> Vibrant 4-bit pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catchy Chiptunes:</strong> Original OPL FM music by naruto2413</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Bezel:</strong> Illustration by Pete Ellison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Competition:</strong> Worldwide leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRT TV Compatible:</strong> Native 240p output with 4:3 aspect ratio</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Looney Landers is a fast-paced arcade party game for 1-2 players. Skydive into a whirlwind of chaos as you compete against friends, family, or the CPU to claim the top spot on the leaderboards in this score-chasing frenzy!",
